{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The engine ships ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"attack"},{"text":" as a stub verb, so every game already knows the word","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and answers it with a sentence. This library takes the word over and puts a body","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behind it. A swing resolves a weapon, rolls once out of a hundred against a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"per-weapon table, and spends the villain’s health; a knockout puts him on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"floor for 2 turns; the last hit prints his death line, runs the host’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDefeat"},{"text":" hook, and removes him from play — so the death line is the last thing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"said about him, and has to account for the body. The exchange a player recognizes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from Zork — swing, answer, swing — is written nowhere. It falls out of the turn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pipeline: the player’s blow resolves in the command stages and the villain’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"lands with the end-of-turn timers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the library claims ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".attack"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MeleeCombat(text:)"},{"text":" is where that verb’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"voice lives. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"text.stubs.attack"},{"text":" is the line a game without combat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints, and a game with this library never prints it. The four refusals the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mechanics own — swinging at something no villain rule claimed, swinging","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bare-handed, naming a feather as a weapon, naming a sword you aren’t holding —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text"},{"text":", passed at init.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"It is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"text":" bundle rather than a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GamePlugin"},{"text":" because it saves a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ledger: each villain’s health, his stun countdown, whether he is currently in a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fight, and the player’s own wounds, keyed by a string the host chooses. Nothing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"else belongs to it. The villains are the host’s actors, the weapons are the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host’s items carrying the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon"},{"text":" trait, and every line","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"either side speaks arrives as ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse"},{"text":", which carry no defaults at all — a library","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot guess a villain’s death sentence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every roll draws from the game’s seeded stream, so a pinned seed replays a fight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"blow for blow. The guards are ordered so quiet turns draw nothing: a villain in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"another room, or behind a closed ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"text":" gate, or already engaged, burns no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"randomness, which is what keeps one villain’s presence from shifting another","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"villain’s draws. Two simplifications are deliberate and want ledgering per game:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the player’s wounds never heal, and a defeated villain stays defeated.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Wiring it in","anchor":"Wiring-it-in","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Mark the weapons, register each villain in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"text":", and splice his","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"counter-attack daemon into ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoMeleeCombat","","struct Cavern: Game {","    let melee = MeleeCombat()","","    let sword = Item {","        name(\"elvish sword\")","        trait(.weapon, true)","        trait(.weaponStrength, 3)   \/\/ a keen blade: misses less, kills more","    }","    let troll = Actor { name(\"troll\") }","    let axe = Item { name(\"bloody axe\") }","    @Global var passageClear = false","","    var content: GameContents { melee }","","    var rules: Rules {","        melee.villain(","            troll, key: \"troll\", strength: 2,","            prose: MeleeCombat.VillainProse(","                miss: [\"The troll swings; the axe bites air.\"],","                wound: [\"Your blow lands, and the troll grunts.\"],","                knockout: \"The troll drops where he stood, out cold.\",","                \/\/ The body dissolves in the line, because the actor is","                \/\/ removed a moment later and nothing else will say so.","                death: \"The troll dies, and his body dissolves.\"),","            onDefeat: {","                passageClear = true          \/\/ unbar the door","                axe.move(to: player.location)  \/\/ and drop the loot","            })","    }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        melee.aggression(","            of: troll, key: \"troll\", named: \"melee.troll\",","            strikesFirst: 33,","            prose: MeleeCombat.AggressionProse(","                miss: [\"The axe passes within an inch of your ear.\"],","                wound: [\"The axe catches your shoulder.\"],","                playerDeath: \"The troll's axe removes your head.\"))","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The two calls share a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key:"},{"text":", and that is the whole of the connection between","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them. A villain registered with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"villain"},{"type":"text","text":" alone never fights back and stays down"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for good once knocked out; one given an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aggression"},{"type":"text","text":" daemon wakes up on his own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every item carrying "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" is eligible by default. A named"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"weapon must carry the trait and be held. With no weapon named, the keenest held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"trait-marked item is chosen; ties follow the inventory’s stable item-ID order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"weapons:"},{"type":"text","text":" only when a particular villain has a narrower vulnerability:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the supplied items form a restriction, and each must still carry "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".weapon"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"The numbers","anchor":"The-numbers","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength"},{"type":"text","text":" slides the outcome cutpoints, out of 100."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Strength 2 is the baseline — miss ≤ 30, wound ≤ 70, knockout ≤ 85, kill above —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a plain "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" with no keenness declared fights as it did"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the trait existed. Strength 1 or less is a clumsy blade at 40\/76\/90;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3 or more is a keen one at 22\/64\/82. When the player names no weapon, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keenest one he is holding serves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counter-attack rolls a flat table: miss ≤ 50, wound ≤ 85, an outright kill"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"above. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"playerStrength"},{"type":"text","text":" is the wound that kills the player: at the default of 2, the first wound is survived and the second is fatal."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"strikesFirst"},{"type":"text","text":" is the odds out of 100 that a villain starts a fight on a turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player hasn’t — 100 fights on sight, 0 only ever answers a blow, and neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of those two values draws from the stream. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra gate checked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the same-room guard, for a villain whose combat is scoped to one room; it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not gate coming round from a knockout, so a man knocked out where his gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is shut still wakes up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"The worked example","anchor":"The-worked-example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"text":" wires two villains against this library. The troll is the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"straightforward one: he blocks a passage, starts a fight one turn in three, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"his axe is lootable once he falls. The thief is the awkward one, and is why","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"when:"},{"text":" exists — he prowls the whole underground picking pockets and fights","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only in his own lair, so his gate is closed on almost every turn he is alive.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"collection","externalID":"GnustoMeleeCombat","roleHeading":"Framework","title":"GnustoMeleeCombat","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"GnustoMeleeCombat"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat"},"abstract":[{"text":"The attack verbs promoted to a mechanic: weapons, villain health, and a villain who answers.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"The-bundle","title":"The bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/init(text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/actions"]},{"anchor":"Registering-a-villain","title":"Registering a villain","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/villain(_:key:strength:weapons:prose:onDefeat:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/aggression(of:key:named:strikesFirst:playerStrength:when:prose:)"]},{"anchor":"Traits-the-host-declares-on-its-items","title":"Traits the host declares on its items","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength"]},{"anchor":"The-systems-own-voice","title":"The system’s own voice","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/init()","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/attackFutile","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/noWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/notAWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/weaponNotHeld"]},{"anchor":"A-villains-lines","title":"A villain’s lines","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/init(miss:wound:knockout:death:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/knockout","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/death"]},{"anchor":"His-counter-attack-lines","title":"His counter-attack lines","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/init(miss:wound:playerDeath:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/playerDeath"]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A villain’s counter-attack lines."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AggressionProse","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AggressionProse","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MeleeCombat.AggressionProse","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/VillainProse/wound":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Lines rotated when the player’s blow wounds.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"wound"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/villainprose\/wound","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/wound","title":"wound","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse/miss":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose\/miss","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","abstract":[{"text":"Lines rotated when the villain’s counter-attack misses.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"miss","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"miss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/Gnusto/TraitKey/weaponStrength":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/gnusto\/traitkey\/weaponstrength","title":"weaponStrength","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"How keen a weapon is in melee — the original’s per-weapon distinction.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A higher value misses less and kills more; the outcome table reads it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to slide the cutpoints. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"2"},{"text":", the baseline table, so a plain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".weapon"},{"text":" with no keenness declared fights exactly as before.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"weaponStrength"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8TraitKeyV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TraitKey"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Value"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]}},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/init(text:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates the plugin with the given combat text."}],"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"text","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MeleeCombat","preciseIdentifier":"s:17GnustoMeleeCombat0bC0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:17GnustoMeleeCombat0bC0V4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/init(text:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/init(text:)","kind":"symbol","title":"init(text:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse/wound":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Lines rotated when the villain’s counter-attack wounds.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"wound"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/Gn